    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Darie Alein",
      "TWA AMBASSADOR SERVICE\nWELCOME ABOARD\nCocktail and Meal Service will begin shortly after take off...\nappetizer\nFRESH SALMON SLICES\nRemoulade sauce\n# * * #p\nentrees\nBEEF BROCHETTE\nCharbroiled tender chunks of choice filet mignon\nserved with braised celery heart and parisienne potatoes\nSWEET \u0026 SOUR PORK LOIN\nCubes of deep fried pork loin in a subtle sweet and\nsour sauce\n...accompanied by yeung chow fried rice\nCHICKEN TAI- PO\nDelicate pieces of spring chicken pan fried with rich piquante soya beans\nto complement this entree we present Cantonese fried noodles\nDinner Roll\nCreamery Butter\n7 10\n4: t\n*\nthe sweet course\nFrom our bake shop we present a rich and delicate pastry\nJasmine Tea\nTWA's Freshly Brewed Coffee\nMilk\nTea\nD-205 22"
